# The collector Pod's CPU request in millicores, read by run.sh, which writes the Pod, and by the session's P4 gate,
# which refuses to buy GPUs when no CPU node has this much unrequested.
# 1000 did not fit on 2026-10-28: the one t3.large has 1,930m allocatable, and the full Kueue controller requests 500m.
# The limit stays one CPU, so the sender can still use a whole core when the node has it idle.
COLLECTOR_CPU_M=250
